               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This P-Channel 2.5â€‰V specified MOSFET is produced using onsemi's advanced POWERTRENCH process that has been especially tailored to minimize the on-state resistance and yet maintain low gate charge for superior switching performance.</rdf:li>
